      "note": "Allocates a CRL object via gnutls_x509_crl_init(crl), storing the heap pointer in *crl. This allocation is triggered when a GNUTLS_BAG_CRL element is found in the PKCS12 bag parsed from the attacker-controlled input.",
      "kind": "source"
