    {
      "file": "lib/x509/pkcs12.c",
      "function": "gnutls_pkcs12_simple_parse",
      "line": null,
      "code": "",
      "note": "After gnutls_x509_crl_import fails, gnutls_x509_crl_deinit(*crl) frees the CRL object but *crl is not set to NULL. The stale pointer remains in *crl, causing the done: cleanup to call gnutls_x509_crl_deinit a second time on freed memory. The fix adds `*crl = NULL;` after this deinit call.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
